ResQNet is a smart disaster management platform that allows citizens to instantly 
send emergency distress alerts with live location during disasters and emergencies. 
The system enables responders, NGOs, and rescue teams to receive real-time alerts and
react quickly for faster coordination and rescue operations. Its goal is to reduce response
time, improve communication, and help save lives through technology-driven emergency support.
